                             "content":  "Kotlin Examples\nKotlin Compiler\nKotlin Exercises\nKotlin Quiz\nKotlin Practice Problems\nKotlin Syllabus\nKotlin Study Plan\n\nny:--\u003e\n\n ny:--\u003e\n\nny:--\u003e\n\nKotlin OOP\n\n❮ Previous\nNext ❯",
                             "heading":  "Kotlin Examples"
