                             "content":  "Kotlin Examples\nKotlin Compiler\nKotlin Exercises\nKotlin Quiz\nKotlin Practice Problems\nKotlin Syllabus\nKotlin Study Plan\n\nny:--\u003e\n\n ny:--\u003e\n\nny:--\u003e\n\nKotlin Constructors\n\n ❮ Previous\n Next ❯",
